": "migrated_image.png", "id": "202132804538375", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139458_316445582025079_523241312_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b6DBEAermiIQ7kNvwEN_HSs&_nc_oc=AdpvBIpjseXQ0QAt2y35MgOqctNTVRY4VVFv_IlG0dW7P4RDY0vTp4Rp3DxN_HuYtLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0ybebksLDqhRVcXE1TnTyb2OJ1GL68wJdoUJaD1Ff73w&oe=69F0A86C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vendetta Online VR", "keywords": ["space", "mmo", "mmorpg", "shooter", "vendetta"], "long_description": "Vendetta Online is a cross-platform 3D space combat MMORPG, allowing thousands of players to interact as the pilots of spaceships in a vast universe. Users may build their characters in any direction they desire, becoming rich captains of industry, military heroes, or outlaws. A fast-paced, realtime \"twitch\" style combat model gives intense action, coupled with the backdrop of RPG gameplay in a massive online galaxy. Three major player factions form a delicate balance of power, with several NPC sub-factions creating situations of economic struggle, political intrigue and conflict. The completely persistent universe and detailed storyline add to the depth of immersion, resulting in a unique online experience.", "short_description": "Vendetta Online is a cross-platform 3D space combat MMORPG, allowing thousands of players to interact as the pilots of spaceships in a vast universe. Users may build their characters in any direction they desire, becoming rich captains of industry, military heroes, or outlaws. A fast-paced, realtime \"twitch\" style combat model gives intense action, coupled with the backdrop of RPG gameplay in a massive online galaxy."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vendetta-online.com/h/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.vendetta-online.com/h/eula.html", "publisher_name": "Guild Software, Inc.", "support_webs